      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:313f4e981ed93ecd1e2df12d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“──真正美丽的程序，\n就是能够静静地正常运作的程序。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "71919d4d722b4f33b277ab93ea5750216d606a3a9e1a8250df36d928eb78da1d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ac3c4b0d98f9a46166fb9cb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她身上的布料是经过计算削减的，\n丝巾则是考量到个人特色而加上……\n其他应该还有许多能聊的部分，结果她──",
      "source_fingerprint": "11cff1bce81727ff5ecd3b294e170f5af3e9fda52b1df42355cfbe4412418f73",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6af1d7416a1c1ca021eca5a5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中神宫",
