      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她像是配合起跑的号令般，瞬间飞奔而出，\n再任由腰间的丝巾随风飞扬，绕着赛道跑。\n然后……",
      "source_fingerprint": "630fb447564ac1aad0c6892aa21a7f0b9e7bc125242da0765af9e88b8db67244",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036513.json",
